WEBVTT

00:02.171 --> 00:06.471
<i>Andy, to protect Fuko, agrees to Shen's proposal
and removes the Card on his forehead,</i>

00:06.471 --> 00:09.185
<i>on the condition that Shen win against him
with his powers unleashed.</i>

00:09.645 --> 00:14.613
<i>Liberation from the Card's suppression causes
his guise to change to long, black hair,</i>

00:14.613 --> 00:17.869
<i>and his personality completely altered as well.</i>

00:18.078 --> 00:21.334
<i>The black-haired man faces Spoil up in space.</i>

00:21.502 --> 00:26.637
<i>This was Victor, a man called the god “Victhor”
as he's won any and every battle.</i>

00:27.012 --> 00:31.981
<i>This overwhelming power of Undead sees no problem against
Spoil's decomposition power even in Phase 2</i>

00:31.981 --> 00:35.655
<i>and he easily takes control of the situation.</i>

00:35.905 --> 00:40.790
<i>Shen, seeking a battle against powerful opponents,
challenges the man back on land.</i>

00:40.790 --> 00:44.171
<i>However, he's forced to admit defeat
to the sheer gap in strength and ability.</i>

00:44.548 --> 00:49.223
<i>But in order to fulfill the promise he made with Andy,
he gives his everything in one blow,</i>

00:49.725 --> 00:52.438
<i>creating a moment of opportunity
to allow his comrades to take over as he falls.</i>

00:52.897 --> 00:55.402
<i>Breaking through space,
the Roundtable members join the fight.</i>

00:56.070 --> 01:00.955
<i>The all-out war between the Union’s most powerful forces
and the strongest man begins.</i>

01:20.995 --> 01:22.957
Top! Get Fuko and Shen!

01:24.043 --> 01:25.880
Division Bullet!

01:32.852 --> 01:37.111
<i>Fast kid... he uses his Negation ability
to his advantage.</i>

01:37.111 --> 01:38.113
<i>But...</i>

01:46.797 --> 01:47.924
SHRINK
Shōusuō.

03:35.015 --> 03:37.812
U-Um... thank you very much.

03:38.104 --> 03:40.693
Hm? Oh, don’t sweat it.

03:40.693 --> 03:42.404
We're on the same team now.

03:43.073 --> 03:45.870
No thanks needed.
I don’t accept 'em or dish 'em out.

03:46.204 --> 03:47.498
Uh, okay...

03:49.293 --> 03:51.297
Why hasn’t he stopped moving?

03:54.095 --> 03:57.852
U-Um... how are we going to stop Andy?

03:58.478 --> 03:59.438
Beats me.

04:00.065 --> 04:03.405
Last time we had old lady Gena,
so that's probably how we got him.

04:03.405 --> 04:05.325
But maybe there's some kinda plan.

04:05.993 --> 04:11.003
E-Excuse me, but...
could you please take me back to Andy?

04:11.630 --> 04:14.636
I just know that I can get him back!

04:14.636 --> 04:19.228
Huh? Have you lost it?
He almost killed you a second ago!

04:19.478 --> 04:22.944
<i>He ain't the same guy you know anymore!</i>

04:23.319 --> 04:25.407
Mr. Shen! Please give me the Card!

04:25.658 --> 04:26.994
Hey!

04:26.994 --> 04:28.622
Before that...

04:31.670 --> 04:37.014
I don't want Mr. Andy to get mad at me,
so take this as a measure to protect yourself.

04:37.347 --> 04:38.391
Shen Bro?

04:42.065 --> 04:43.401
DO YOUR BEST
Jiāyóu.

04:47.493 --> 04:49.163
Hey! Wait up a sec!

04:50.875 --> 04:53.506
Hey, Shen Bro!
Stop her, will you?

04:55.300 --> 04:58.473
Didn't I tell you she's interesting?

04:58.641 --> 05:00.435
This is no time to laugh!

05:00.895 --> 05:03.233
I'm in no position to stop her.

05:03.651 --> 05:05.237
I did quite a bit of stuff on my own, too.

05:05.822 --> 05:06.447
Besides...

05:07.199 --> 05:12.209
If she were that easy to stop,
then she wouldn't be alive today.

05:19.473 --> 05:22.437
You've at least got a plan, li'l brat?

05:23.356 --> 05:24.901
Thank you so much!

05:25.443 --> 05:30.328
My name is Fuko and I'm 18 years old.
Pleased to work with you!

05:30.663 --> 05:33.502
You wanna do self-intros now
of all times? Unreal!

05:33.878 --> 05:36.340
The name's Top! I'm 15!

05:37.467 --> 05:39.514
You're even more of a brat than me!

05:39.681 --> 05:42.060
I'm not a brat!
I'm in junior high!

05:42.060 --> 05:43.647
You're more of a brat than me!

05:43.647 --> 05:45.358
What was that?

05:45.358 --> 05:46.737
I'm eighteen years old!

05:46.737 --> 05:48.616
So you are a brat!

05:48.616 --> 05:49.491
I'm telling you-

05:49.491 --> 05:50.285
I'm in ju-

05:55.170 --> 05:57.382
Tatiana, help!

06:05.440 --> 06:07.152
You're pretty damn sturdy.

06:11.160 --> 06:13.958
Big guy must have some sort
of hardening ability.

06:14.416 --> 06:16.379
And as for that runt...

06:16.630 --> 06:19.093
His entire body is made up of Artifacts.

06:19.636 --> 06:22.057
How can he keep his mind together like so?

06:23.393 --> 06:25.523
Some sort of risk-avoidance ability?

06:29.948 --> 06:30.866
A flaming sword!

06:30.866 --> 06:33.831
That's UMA Burn's handiwork!

06:34.456 --> 06:36.127
Not bad, Juiz.

06:43.559 --> 06:46.732
Hey, what the heck?
There're a ton of Undeads over there!

06:50.321 --> 06:52.827
You're right!
I didn't even know he could do that!

06:53.202 --> 06:54.789
So, what do we do now?

06:55.123 --> 06:57.461
We can't even tell 'em apart!

06:57.461 --> 07:00.216
They're all just a bunch of naked torsos.

07:00.467 --> 07:01.845
Hmm...

07:15.205 --> 07:15.831
That one!

07:17.375 --> 07:20.758
The one fighting against the Boss!
Andy is inside of that one!

07:21.300 --> 07:25.433
Inside? He looks just like all the others!

07:26.520 --> 07:28.690
He's the only one with a katana...

07:29.609 --> 07:31.696
...and I see remnants of Clothy on him!

07:31.696 --> 07:32.573
"Clothy"?

07:33.199 --> 07:35.704
Never mind that.
Just stick to the plan, please!

07:35.704 --> 07:37.249
Bring me right to him!

07:40.965 --> 07:44.556
You got it!
But don't blame me if things go south!

08:00.044 --> 08:00.713
Huh?

08:09.772 --> 08:10.315
What?

08:14.574 --> 08:19.208
Do you... really think this'll do the trick, Fuko?

08:19.416 --> 08:20.836
Yeah! Maybe!

08:21.212 --> 08:23.926
Whaddaya mean, "maybe"!?

08:39.041 --> 08:43.842
If I stay latched onto him like this,
no matter how much I dislike him...

08:43.842 --> 08:46.180
...a big stroke of unluck is sure to come eventually!

08:46.723 --> 08:51.232
And once he weakens,
I just need to stick this Card back into him-

08:51.232 --> 08:52.944
About how long do you have to touch him?

08:53.319 --> 08:57.077
I have no idea!
I've never clung onto someone I hated for long!

09:00.626 --> 09:04.593
If he were Andy, a large stroke
of unluck would come with a moment, correct?

09:04.593 --> 09:06.095
I hate to admit it, but yes!

09:06.429 --> 09:08.684
Then we're changing the strategy.

09:10.478 --> 09:14.361
You'll have to bring back Andy's personality,
even for a split second.

09:15.280 --> 09:19.079
In that moment, if you impart your unluck on him,
then just maybe...

09:19.288 --> 09:20.791
Bring him back...

09:21.042 --> 09:23.254
Bring back? You moron.

09:23.922 --> 09:25.718
I am the original!

09:26.803 --> 09:31.688
He's been putting up quite the fight inside me,
but he'll never see the light of day again.

09:39.119 --> 09:40.998
Division Bullet!

09:58.659 --> 10:02.792
Why are you protecting her?
you defeated Burn and gained an extra seat!

10:02.792 --> 10:04.838
If Unluck dies,
that means two seats open!

10:05.171 --> 10:08.261
I'll just go find even stronger Negators
to fill the roles, and...

10:14.524 --> 10:19.868
Those who lack justice and ambition
cannot influence the actions of others, Victor.

10:20.536 --> 10:22.122
Bunch of halfwits.

10:29.094 --> 10:32.810
All members,
defeat the copies and protect Fuko!

10:32.810 --> 10:33.937
- Roger
- Roger!

10:34.354 --> 10:36.150
I guess it's started.

10:36.150 --> 10:37.152
RETURN
Huílái.

10:40.116 --> 10:42.830
That's a good staff, Nyoi-Kinko.

10:52.140 --> 10:53.519
Ms. Juiz!

10:57.860 --> 11:01.200
Quit looking away and focus on persuading him!

11:02.369 --> 11:03.120
On it!

11:03.664 --> 11:04.749
Andy, please!

11:06.252 --> 11:08.757
Come out, even if just for a second!
You have to give me a-

11:13.725 --> 11:15.019
We've got you covered!

11:15.019 --> 11:16.523
Only you can bring him back!

11:22.200 --> 11:23.870
<i>He got a bead on where I was heading next!?</i>

11:24.496 --> 11:25.290
Mr. Top!

11:25.874 --> 11:28.045
<i>Gotta think.
C'mon, think.</i>

11:28.045 --> 11:31.761
<i>I've got to bring Andy back... but how?</i>

11:32.513 --> 11:34.726
<i>It's barely been a month since we first met.</i>

11:35.059 --> 11:39.318
<i>We've traveled to so many places,
and so much has happened...</i>

11:42.032 --> 11:45.623
<i>...but I still don't know a thing about Andy.</i>

11:46.541 --> 11:49.004
<i>His likes, his dislikes...</i>

11:49.296 --> 11:51.676
<i>What happened in his past...</i>

11:52.970 --> 11:55.684
<i>But I need to find something, gotta think!</i>

11:56.101 --> 11:58.147
<i>Just like the first day we met...</i>

11:58.899 --> 12:03.157
<i>...when Andy saved me,
and let me live.</i>

12:18.605 --> 12:20.108
<i>Now it's my turn.</i>

12:26.997 --> 12:27.915
Hm?

12:36.140 --> 12:39.187
<i>This scar isn't on any of the other copies!</i>

12:39.689 --> 12:42.152
You've got him locked up in there, don't you?

12:42.653 --> 12:45.534
Give... Andy back!

12:49.667 --> 12:52.840
Andy, you can do it!
Don't let this guy beat you!

12:54.594 --> 12:59.645
You just have to touch me for a second!
Once you do, I'll give you...

13:00.188 --> 13:03.528
...the biggest stroke of unluck you've ever seen!

13:16.721 --> 13:19.852
Now that... sounds like a treat.

13:20.979 --> 13:21.815
Andy!

13:22.357 --> 13:23.527
Time's a wastin'.

13:25.029 --> 13:25.948
I'm taking it.

13:25.989 --> 13:26.658
Huh?

13:37.888 --> 13:38.890
What?

13:38.890 --> 13:39.767
Huh?

14:03.314 --> 14:05.611
We'll pick this up again next time.

14:05.861 --> 14:09.034
Huh...? Oh... P-Pick what up?

14:10.161 --> 14:12.040
U-Um...

14:13.167 --> 14:15.589
N-No way! In your dreams!

14:15.881 --> 14:17.425
- Hmm?
- What?

14:18.553 --> 14:22.393
What are you all standing around for?
The unluck is coming!

14:22.393 --> 14:24.523
You have to get out of here! Quick!

14:26.026 --> 14:27.111
All hands, fall back!

14:27.362 --> 14:28.615
- Roger!
- Roger!

14:34.961 --> 14:37.675
Morons... you're not getting away.

14:38.885 --> 14:41.516
Tch. You again, huh?

14:42.726 --> 14:45.231
I can activate my ability so long as you're visible.

14:45.774 --> 14:47.861
I fibbed about needing you to be within a certain distance.

14:50.032 --> 14:51.284
TILL WE MEET AGAIN
Zàijiàn, Victor.

14:53.999 --> 14:57.506
It's been quite some time...
since I've lost to humans.

15:37.335 --> 15:40.007
The town has been decimated.

15:43.681 --> 15:45.727
This is unreal.

15:47.898 --> 15:49.150
Huh? Where's Fuko?

15:55.329 --> 15:57.333
Is that dummy going in by herself!?

15:57.333 --> 15:58.127
Will she be okay?

15:58.418 --> 16:00.047
The water is going to flood back in!

16:13.407 --> 16:15.327
You're one hell of a gal.

16:16.037 --> 16:17.583
Please, Andy!

16:19.335 --> 16:20.462
Come back!

16:24.513 --> 16:25.849
This should...

16:35.369 --> 16:37.875
AUGUST 31ST

16:50.316 --> 16:51.360
Andy!

16:51.360 --> 16:52.780
Yeah. You rang?

16:54.659 --> 16:55.577
Huh?

16:55.577 --> 16:57.581
Finally up, eh?

16:57.581 --> 17:01.589
I ended up reading all 101 volumes
of this You-Me stuff.

17:01.589 --> 17:06.014
Gotta admit, it's a fun read.
Shojo manga ain't too bad sometimes.

17:22.088 --> 17:23.967
Why'd you do something like that?

17:23.967 --> 17:29.854
You and Mr. Shen cooked up this whole thing...
and didn't tell me a thing!

17:31.733 --> 17:36.116
If the members of the Roundtable hadn't shown up,
you wouldn't be here right now!

17:36.116 --> 17:39.456
If... If things hadn't worked out...

17:45.802 --> 17:49.977
I would have... been all alone again.

17:57.158 --> 17:58.369
Sorry 'bout that.

17:58.369 --> 18:01.041
Aah! If you touch my head-

18:01.041 --> 18:02.920
I heard you the entire time.

18:03.170 --> 18:09.892
<i>After he swallowed me up... in the darkness,
the only thing I could hear was your voice.</i>

18:11.604 --> 18:13.065
It made me happy.

18:14.234 --> 18:16.405
Thanks, Fuko.

18:19.494 --> 18:20.831
"Fuko"...

18:21.874 --> 18:25.507
No way! You finally said it!
You actually called me by my name!

18:25.507 --> 18:27.176
The meeting's starting soon.

18:27.636 --> 18:33.188
Hold on! Hey, say it again! Just once more!
I didn't hear it clearly!

18:33.188 --> 18:36.654
Shut your trap and suit up already, brat.

18:37.363 --> 18:40.369
Aww, you went back to normal.

18:46.089 --> 18:48.803
Oh, by the way, who's this little guy?

18:48.803 --> 18:52.268
Oh, that? The ball brat dropped that off
when they came to visit.

18:54.857 --> 18:57.696
I see, so Tatiana...

18:58.531 --> 19:00.827
By the way, those kids came by, too.

19:02.497 --> 19:05.504
All those runts that you
and the damn brat rescued.

19:17.109 --> 19:19.573
TO BIG SISTER

19:19.823 --> 19:23.540
I see. I'm glad Ken's group
of kids were okay, too.

19:23.915 --> 19:29.552
I heard that the Union's orphanage
are gonna take care of them till they're 18.

19:29.552 --> 19:34.562
Though they gotta fend for themselves after that...
but well, they'll be okay.

19:34.562 --> 19:36.858
They seem to have the guts to survive.

19:37.693 --> 19:38.862
Andy...

19:39.905 --> 19:44.455
You think their memories
of their teacher turn into sad ones?

19:55.604 --> 20:01.699
Of course not. I'm the one
that married her, so there's no doubt.

20:02.116 --> 20:04.914
She felt so strongly about all of them.

20:12.345 --> 20:16.812
I'm sure powerful emotions reach
their destinations without spoiling.

20:17.355 --> 20:19.484
Just like how yours did.

20:22.574 --> 20:23.534
Yup!

20:26.289 --> 20:29.963
How's that for words of a guy
that lived 200 years?

20:29.963 --> 20:32.218
It's pretty darn persuasive, ain't it?

20:32.218 --> 20:33.763
This sure has got to increase my likability-

20:33.763 --> 20:35.725
No!

20:35.725 --> 20:37.729
Hot! So hot! I'm burning! So hot!

20:37.813 --> 20:41.152
Oh, the stroke of unluck from earlier.

20:44.702 --> 20:48.960
You're late, ya looney lovebirds!
The meeting was supposed to start ages ago.

20:49.168 --> 20:51.214
I apologize for being late!

20:53.260 --> 20:56.141
Hey, your boyfriend's burnin' up.
You sure things are all right?

20:56.642 --> 20:59.857
Sorry, we had an accident along the way.

21:00.399 --> 21:04.073
And we're not lovebirds.
Can't argue the looney part, though.

21:11.254 --> 21:14.135
Now, be seated... IX and X.

21:16.891 --> 21:18.686
<i>You're in the wrong seat, Andy.</i>

21:19.145 --> 21:23.153
You're X. I'm IX now,
thanks to the Clothes incident.

21:31.796 --> 21:34.760
Oh, so the order's changed.
Okay, then.

21:36.514 --> 21:40.855
Everyone is seated, then.
Proceed, Apocalypse.

21:41.022 --> 21:42.567
Yes.

21:43.528 --> 21:46.282
Quest results!

21:52.336 --> 22:00.477
I declare to those sitting at the Roundtable.
The results of the six quests given to you...

22:00.979 --> 22:05.989
TO BE CONTINUED

23:36.002 --> 23:36.461
PREVIEW

23:36.879 --> 23:39.718
<i>Judgment befalls the members
of the Roundtable now that the quests are complete.</i>

23:40.177 --> 23:44.978
<i>There, the undead man and the girl see
a glimpse of the Rules that constitute the world.</i>

23:45.103 --> 23:48.527
<i>Next episode of Undead Unluck,
Episode 10-Result.</i>

23:48.652 --> 23:50.573
<i>In search of the greatest death ever.</i>
